OL,3,GNEWSAForest school 'won't be stopped'
OL,4,Aby attacks
OL,5,
OL,6,FA charity staging outdoor education
OL,7,Fsessions for children is determined to
OL,8,Fcontinue its work despite its "forest
OL,9,Fclassroom" being hit by a series of
OL,10,Ffires.
OL,12,FStomping Grounds North East has been
OL,13,Frunning sessions at Gateshead's
OL,14,FRiverside Park since 2024, but the site
OL,15,Foverlooking the River Tyne was targeted
OL,16,Fagain last weekend.
OL,18,FProject manager Sam Tranter said the
OL,19,Fproblems were frustrating but "we're
OL,20,Freally determined" and "won't stop".
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,395,390,260,160,0,100
