OL,3,GNEWSAForest school 'won't be stopped'
OL,4,Aby attacks
OL,5,
OL,6,FGateshead Council, which contracts
OL,7,FStomping Grounds North East to run the
OL,8,Fclasses, said the attacks were "totally
OL,9,Funacceptable" and called for people to
OL,10,Freport incidents to police and fire
OL,11,Fservices.
